# Danger Monitor System V2 — Implementation Plan

Building the complete Danger Monitor System per [DangerMonitor_PGC_Challenge_Build_Spec_v2.md](file:///d:/Antigravity/Projects/Danger%20Monitoring%20System%20V2/MD%20Files/DangerMonitor_PGC_Challenge_Build_Spec_v2.md). The system has **5 major components**: shared LoRa protocol, wearable firmware, receiver firmware, Netlify backend, React frontend dashboard, and a standalone data-collection tool + Python validation script.

Patterns from [GuardianTrack](file:///d:/Antigravity/Projects/GPS_Audio/GPS-Audio) (WiFi captive portal, local queue, HTTP upload, Netlify Blobs store) are adapted directly.

