#### [NEW] [detection.h](file:///d:/Antigravity/Projects/Danger%20Monitoring%20System%20V2/wearable/detection.h) / [detection.cpp](file:///d:/Antigravity/Projects/Danger%20Monitoring%20System%20V2/wearable/detection.cpp)
- **Fall FSM**: `FS_IDLE → FS_FREEFALL → FS_WAIT_IMPACT → FS_STILLNESS → FS_CONFIRMED`
  - Freefall: `A_m < 0.40g` sustained ≥100ms
  - Impact: `A_m > 3.00g` within 500ms window
  - Stillness: `σ(A_m) < 0.15g` over 2000ms
- **Skid detection**: `|ay| > 2.0g AND |gx| > 330°/s` sustained ≥200ms
- **Direct impact**: `A_m > 4.50g` with 5000ms debounce
- **Environmental**: 50-sample rolling buffer, σ-based ground-shock vs wave-motion classification
- All thresholds as `config.h` constants for easy tuning

#### [NEW] [lora_tx.h](file:///d:/Antigravity/Projects/Danger%20Monitoring%20System%20V2/wearable/lora_tx.h) / [lora_tx.cpp](file:///d:/Antigravity/Projects/Danger%20Monitoring%20System%20V2/wearable/lora_tx.cpp)
